* Confucius: because his teachings and writings have influenced me profoundly;
* Alexander the Great: his conquests spanned from Macedonia to India and he's known for being innovative and adaptable in foreign policy, similar to Alibaba Cloud's values;
* Leonardo da Vinci: he was an ingenious polymath that created many groundbreaking works.

I can see us having an interesting discussion about the intersection of technology and culture.
